      "message": "\u003e So as you suggested, lets handle `kvm_arch_destroy_vm` which is the only one left out in the current logic\n\nIt is not left out, it itself calls `kvm_x86_call(vm_destroy)(kvm)` and does nothing more, so replacing it with `kvm_arch_destroy_vm()` here would be just a cosmetic improvement.",
